            <ArticleTitle>Pregabalin and duloxetine for the treatment of neuropathic pain disorders.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>79-84</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Clinical studies investigating the use of pregabalin and duloxetine for the management of diabetic peripheral neuropathy and post-herpetic neuralgia are reviewed. The benefits and potential drawbacks associated with these agents are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
